OL,3,GNEWSAChemical site flood defences given
OL,4,Agreen light
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major infrastructure project aiming
OL,7,Fto boost flood defences has been given
OL,8,Fthe go-ahead.
OL,10,FHartlepool Borough Council's planning
OL,11,Fcommittee has backed plans for land
OL,12,Fnext to Greatham Works site off Tees
OL,13,FRoad, which would involve enbankments
OL,14,Fbeing constructed or realigned with
OL,15,Fnearby water bodies.
OL,17,FA report presented to councillors said
OL,18,Fthe plans, which form part of a wider
OL,19,Fstrategy aiming to "deliver essential
OL,20,Fflood risk infrastructure throughout
OL,21,Fthe Tees Estuary", would "reduce the
OL,22,Frisk of tidal flooding".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
