OL,3,GNEWSAChemical site flood defences given
OL,4,Agreen light
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement with the application noted
OL,7,Fthe current flood alleviation scheme
OL,8,Fembankments were in a "poor condition"
OL,9,Fand the scheme would protect chemical
OL,10,Fplants at the site.
